<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-ANI acquires galvanising business.</title>
<headline>RTRS-ANI acquires galvanising business.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Engineering group Australian National Industries Ltd (ANI) said on Monday that it had acquired the business assets of Newcastle Galvanising Services Pty Ltd (NGS) for an undisclosed sum.</p>
<p>NGS operates a hot dip galvanising process at its plant in Lambton, Newcastle, servicing the mining, building and construction industries, ANI said.</p>
<p>ANI said NGS already supplies galvanising services to the ANI Strata Products Division for its strata control products.</p>
<p>It will now form part of the Division under a new name - ANI Newcastle Galvanising, ANI said.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
